    {"id":"e0a63d50-e3a2-4bba-8073-de2bc4c3fbad","name":"Sticky Note 0531fc55","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","typeVersion":1,"position":[672,2832],"parameters":{"content":"## Treatment Plan Follow-up (Gmail Approval Flow)\nWhen a consultation ends with TP_SCHEDULED: NO, this starts a 1/3/7/14/30-day follow-up drip. Each stage: AI drafts the SMS copy -> a Gmail draft asks the dentist to forward/reply to approve -> a Gmail trigger detects the approval and Twilio sends the exact approved text, then advances to the next stage. A booking on the Appointments calendar auto-marks the plan CONVERTED; reaching Day 30 with no booking marks it EXPIRED and emails the dentist. State lives in the \"treatment_plan_followups\" Data Table instead of long Wait nodes.","color":4}}
